// width == halfwidth == 8 on purpose. BDFfont draws anything at or above U+0100
// at the FULL width, and four of the Turkish letters live there, so with the
// two set apart a word would come out with its s narrow and its s-cedilla
// twice as wide.
const lgfx::BDFfont FontTr(kBitmaps, kIndex, sizeof(kIndex) / 2,
                           /*w*/ 8, /*halfwidth*/ 8, /*h*/ 16,
                           /*baseline*/ 12, /*y_advance*/ 16);

